            title: 'Tute habanero',
            subtitle: 'Card Game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Two-player Tute variant with eight cards each and a stock; same as Tute corriente except capote (announce to take all last eight tricks). 40-card Spanish.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Tute habanero is a Tute variant played with a 40-card Spanish deck in Spain and Cuba.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Two players only; no partnerships. Each plays for themselves. Head-to-head variant of Tute (same as Tute corriente) with eight cards each, a face-up trump card, and a face-down stock. Non-dealer leads first; after each trick both players draw from the stock until it is exhausted, then follow suit and beat or trump.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '40-card Spanish pack.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Cards',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Eight cards each, one at a time; next card turned face up for trump; remainder forms stock face down.',
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
