    setupContent: {
      players: 'Two players only; no partnerships. Each plays for themselves. Head-to-head variant of Tute (same as Tute corriente) with eight cards each, a face-up trump card, and a face-down stock. Non-dealer leads first; after each trick both players draw from the stock until it is exhausted, then follow suit and beat or trump.',
